    "title": "This Tiny Texas Town Has A Totally Unique Underground High School - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Aspermont\nThis Tiny Texas Town Has A Totally Unique Underground High School\nBy Chrissy,\n1 hours agoHave you ever heard of Aspermont, Texas? Probably not. If you blink, you'll miss it. It's a tiny little town in Stonewall County with a lot of heart. Everyone knows one another, and everyone is friendly. It's a great place to raise a family if you aren't interested in big city life. The high school was built back in 1966 as a bomb shelter for the community during the Cold War Era. The high school doesn't have a single window, and is built almost completely underground.",
